<div class="tib"><div class="lab">TIBETAN (WYLIE)</div>
<span class="u" data-d="1" data-l="s194S"><span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s194w1">rgyu mthun</span> pa&#x27;i <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s194w2">&#x27;bras bu</span> ni, <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s194w3">ngan &#x27;gro</span> nas <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s194w4">mir</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s194w5">skyes</span> <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s194w6">kyang</span> <span class="u" data-d="3" data-l="s194w7">rim pa ltar</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s194w8">tshe</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s194w9">thung ba</span> dang <span class="u" data-d="3" data-l="s194w10">longs spyod kyis phongs pa</span> dang <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s194w11">chung ma</span> <span class="u" data-d="3" data-l="s194w12">ma bsrungs par</span> &#x27;gyur ba dang , <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s194w13">skur pa</span> mang ba dang <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s194w14">mdza&#x27; bo</span> dang <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s194w15">&#x27;bye ba</span> dang <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s194w16">yid du mi &#x27;ong ba</span>&#x27;i <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s194w17">sgra</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s194w18">thos pa</span> dang gzhan gyis tshig mi <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s194w19">nyan pa</span> dang , <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s194w20">chags</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s194w21">sdang</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s194w22">rmongs</span> gsum <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s194w23">shas che ba</span>&#x27;o</span>
