<div class="note"><b>AI NOTE</b> &mdash; PROVISIONAL machine alignment reconciled by Codex. The deprivation and negative keeping constructions are whole d3 recasts. skur pa owns don't believe, an attested HGM glossary equivalent in this reputational context; the added truth and speech elaboration remains unwrapped. nyan pa owns listens; the negative subject and supplied you are not assigned to isolated particles. shas che ba owns only the first dominated, in item 8; repeated English predicates and personality remain unwrapped. gsum is represented by enumeration and omitted. mir retains fused case morphology. No uncertainty is represented as null.</div>
